OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CFriday:FIt will be a rather damp and   
OL,6,Fmurky day on Friday, with persistent   
OL,7,Frain and widespread low cloud. Winds   
OL,8,Ftend to ease and it will feel less     
OL,9,Fcold than Thursday.                    
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThe    
OL,12,Fweekend will likely be unsettled at    
OL,13,Ffirst with strong winds and heavy      
OL,14,Frain, but conditions probably becoming 
OL,15,Fdrier and brighter by Monday. Frosty   
OL,16,Fovernight at first, but trending       
OL,17,Fmilder.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
